Also, Rodney will get recreated if dead.

> If he gets the Amulet, will he continue to chase me?
> He didn't seem to once I level teleported far away, but when I was
> nearby (within a floor or two), he always seemed to come after me.

He will chase you if you are on the same level, but the only way he can
leave the level is to climb the stairs, follow you up or down stairs,
jump through a trapdoor, or follow you down a trapdoor.

If he is alive and has the amulet on a different level of the dungeon,
he will not bother you until you enter that level again.

