> Any good ways to kill him quickly? I had *very* bad luck with death
> rays. Before he stole my artifact, on the very first encounter, I
> missed him repeatedly with a wand, even bouncing it off a wall.

The best way to insta-kill Rodney is to hit him with a wielded
cockatrice egg. A cockatrice/chickatrice corpse will also work, but
poses a serious danger to you.  Levitate and beware of anything that
might steal your gloves when wielding your rubber chicken.  If you laid
the cockatrice egg yourself, breaking it will give you -1 to luck, so
be aware.

Casting FoDeath is also more likely to hit than zapping a wand of
death.

Poking him with Magicbane will work if you are doing it from the up
stairs.

Using Stormbringer is also useful.  As it drains levels from him, he
loses the ability to cast the more damaging spells.

